}],"abstract":[{"text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken":{"title":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleFontCompositeSemanticToken"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplefontcompositesemantictoken","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FontCompositeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":" depending to size classes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":